  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large Dutch oven over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is translucent.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin, ground coriander, and cayenne pepper, if using.",
    "Add the vegetarian haggis and cook, breaking it up with a spoon, until it is no longer raw.",
    "Add the chickpeas, dried apricots, and low sodium vegetable broth to the pot.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 30 minutes.",
    "Season the tagine with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh parsley or cilantro, if desired."
